 if(p){const q=VC.publicQuote(state,id,fraction);modal(`<div class="eyebrow">上市持仓</div><h2>${esc(companyName(c))} · 持有还是减持</h2><p>持有 ${pct(c.equity)} 股权，账面价值 ${num(c.value*c.equity)} 万；累计减持回款 ${num(c.proceeds)} 万，历年分红 ${num(c.dividendReceived)} 万。</p><div class="operating-metrics"><div><label>可流通股权</label><b>${pct(q.available)}</b></div><div><label>仍在锁定</label><b>${pct(q.locked)}</b></div><div><label>预计净到账 / 万</label><b>${num(q.proceeds)}</b></div></div><p>本年可减持额度为 ${pct(q.tradable)} 公司股权，已考虑流通股份与市场承接能力。选择卖出本年额度的比例，每年最多办理一次；锁定股份不提前卖出。${q.locked>0?'现有锁定股份最迟于 '+q.unlockYear+' 年按条款解锁。':''}交易费用按卖出金额的 0.3% 扣除。</p><div class="financing-options">${[.25,.5,1].map(n=>`<button data-float="${n}" class="${n===fraction?'primary':''}">${pct(n)} 本年额度</button>`).join('')}</div>${!q.ok?'<p class="round-note">'+esc(q.reason)+'</p>':''}<div class="modal-actions capital-decision-actions"><button id="capital-close">继续持有</button><button class="primary" id="confirm-float" ${q.ok?'':'disabled'}>确认减持</button></div>${capitalHistory(c)}`);document.querySelectorAll('[data-float]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>capitalDesk(id,null,Number(b.dataset.float)));$('capital-close').onclick=close;$('confirm-float').onclick=()=>{if(VC.sellPublic(state,id,fraction)){close();render();if(c.status!=='active')showExitNotice([id]);else toast('减持款已结算，剩余股份继续持有。');}};return;}
 const venues=VC.listingVenues(state,c),chosen=venue||venues.at(-1).key,q=VC.listingQuote(state,id,chosen);
